        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "I think this problem can be delegated to `vim.fn.indent` though, where it will report the whole `\\t\\t` as indented.\r\n\r\nNot only `dai`, but when you `cc` in a single line of If's body that has content before, ident guide will shift outer a level.  ",
